          "literal": "$$\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n0 & 1\\\\\n0 & 0\n\\end{pmatrix}\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n0 & 1\\\\\n0 & 0\n\\end{pmatrix}^{\\dagger}\n=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n0 & 1\\\\\n0 & 0\n\\end{pmatrix}\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n0 & 0\\\\\n1 & 0\n\\end{pmatrix}\n=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1 & 0\\\\\n0 & 0\n\\end{pmatrix}\n$$",
